fix: provider-aware chat <-> terminal tab conversion for Opencode

When right-clicking an Opencode-backed json-claude chat tab and choosing
"Switch to Terminal mode", Harness was hardcoding agentKind: 'claude'
and using the local tab id as the terminal sessionId. This meant the
Opencode CLI could not resume the existing session.

Changes:
- panes-fsm.ts convertTabType(): determine provider from the source tab
  (provider field for json-claude, agentKind for agent). Pass it as
  newProvider in the tabTypeChanged dispatch. For opencode chat tabs,
  use providerSessionId as the terminal sessionId so the CLI resumes
  the correct session. Relax the agent->chat refusal to allow opencode
  agent tabs too (codex is still blocked).
- terminals.ts tabTypeChanged reducer: use newProvider to set agentKind
  instead of hardcoding 'claude'. When converting opencode chat ->
  terminal, use providerSessionId as the sessionId when present.
- Add tests in terminals.test.ts and panes-fsm.test.ts covering:
  * opencode chat -> opencode terminal
  * opencode terminal -> opencode chat
  * claude chat -> claude terminal (regression)
  * codex agent -> chat still refused
